        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-23T19:04:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not sure where to put this, so I'll just put it in this thread (didn't see the need to create a whole new thread for one tiny little thing) as it relates to one of the nwe heroes…</p>\n<p>One of Plague Rat's cards, Shadowy Ambush, has an image of Chrono Ranger walking along holding some kind of crossbow-gun thingy while a shadowed creature with crazy eyes (presumably Plague Rat…?) sneaks up behind him. The \"problem\" with this? Chrono Ranger is holding the crossbow-looking thingy in his <span class=\"bbcode-i\">left</span> hand. You know, the one that got bitten off by a rat-monster thingy. I did wonder whether perhaps this was an image of the moment right <span class=\"bbcode-i\">before</span> he got his arm bitten off…but at that point he hadn't met Con so wouldn't have any snazzy new weapons like that crossbow thingy - he'd just have his normal cowboy pistol thingy.</p>\n<p>Right?</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
